+# Plan
+
+1. Make order detail conversion tolerate a missing customer row: retain the order's snapshot fields and leave only the readable customer unset.
+2. Change the admin customer-order endpoint to build an order criterion from the requested customer id and query orders without requiring a live customer. Populate customer data only when the account still exists.
+3. Correct shared page-count calculation to use ceiling division, preserve zero for no pages, and ensure order repository results always carry matching totals and an empty list for no matches. Keep the existing newest-first ordering and filters.
+4. Add or update focused tests for deleted-customer detail/list behavior, empty customer-id results, admin filtering/pagination/out-of-range pages, and email re-registration isolation where the project’s existing test structure supports them.
+5. Build the affected Maven modules and run the relevant test suites; inspect failures and adjust the implementation if needed.
